## 2. Literary Content, Characters, World Lore & Audio Recordings — All Rights Reserved

Copyright (c) 2024–2026 Lê Việt Hồng (Le Viet Hong). All Rights Reserved.

All literary texts, book manuscripts, series bibles, world-building lore, character personas, audio recordings, artwork, cover illustrations, and brand assets contained in this repository are the exclusive intellectual property of the author, **Lê Việt Hồng**.

### Specifically Protected Assets:
- **Manuscripts & Story Content**: All text and markdown files within `content/` (including `content/03_BOOK_ONE/`, `content/03_BOOK_ONE_VIETNAMESE/`, `content/01_SERIES_BIBLE/`, and subsequent volumes)
- **Audiobook Recordings**: All audio assets within `public/audio/` (including all synthesized narrator tracks, voice models, and MP3 files)
- **Visual & Brand Assets**: Cover artwork, typography identity, and branding elements within `public/` and `src/`

### Permitted Uses:
- Viewing, reading, and listening to the materials online or through downloaded offline reader formats (EPUB, PDF, Markdown, MP3) for personal, non-commercial, private study and enjoyment.
- Fair dealing or fair use citations (quotes, reviews, academic analysis) with appropriate attribution to Lê Việt Hồng and *The Thread Seers*.

### Prohibited Uses (Without Prior Written Permission):
- Commercial redistribution, resale, sublicensing, or publication of the novel, translations, or audiobooks in any physical or digital format.
- Creating unauthorized derivative literary, audio, cinematic, game, or theatrical adaptations based on the characters, plot, magic system, or world of *The Thread Seers*.
- Using the manuscript, world lore, or character names to train proprietary artificial intelligence or commercial language generation models without an explicit license from the copyright holder.

